OL,3,GNEWSAResidents' concerns after Hull
OL,4,ACity car crashes
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents near Hull City's training
OL,7,Fground say they are concerned about
OL,8,Fsafety after two players overturned
OL,9,Ftheir cars on the same street within
OL,10,Fweeks of each other.
OL,12,FBoth players escaped without injury
OL,13,Ffollowing the crashes near the club's
OL,14,Ftraining ground on Mill House Woods
OL,15,FLane in Cottingham, East Yorkshire.
OL,17,FCarol White, who lives on the narrow
OL,18,Fstreet, said: "Maybe the Football
OL,19,FAssociation ought to pay to do some
OL,20,Ftraining with them about being
OL,21,Fconsiderate drivers."
